g=\"zh-Hans\">把你的书和笔记本收起来</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しまった</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">糟糕；完了；哎呀；哦不</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216081\">しまった！ウッカリして、<ruby>携帯電話<rp>(</rp><rt>けいたいでんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をお<ruby>店<rp>(</rp><rt>みせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>忘<rp>(</rp><rt>わす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れてきちゃった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哦,不,我没注意,把手机忘在餐厅里了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">示す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しめす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">展示；示范；说明；举例；表明；指向；指示（手指、时针、指针等）；表示；显示；代表；意味；呈现</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210237\">その<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>恐怖<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>示<rp>(</rp><rt>しめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那个男孩没有表现出恐惧。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">占める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">占</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>女性<rp>(</rp><rt>じょせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>全体<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>六割<rp>(</rp><rt>ろくわり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>占<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">女性占整体的六成。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">霜</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しも</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">霜；白发；灰发</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"172216\"><ruby>今朝<rp>(</rp><rt>けさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>地面<rp>(</rp><rt>じめん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>霜<rp>(</rp><rt>しも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>覆<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>われていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">今天早上地面上布满了冰霜</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">借金</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゃっきん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">债务；贷款；负债；借款；（棒球）负场多于胜场的场数差；负胜差</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"177166\"><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>借金<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃっきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>払<rp>(</rp><rt>はら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うべきだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你应该还清你的债</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しゃべる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">说话；聊天；闲聊</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"202595\">つい<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>病気<rp>(</rp><rt>びょうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だということをしゃべってしまった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我只是让他生病了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">州</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">州（美国、澳大利亚、印度、德国等的）；省（如加拿大）；郡（如英国）；地区（如意大利）；（瑞士的）州；大陆；洲；（日本古代的）州；（中国古代的）州；府；亲（表亲昵的后缀）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"123200\"><ruby>南部<rp>(</rp><rt>なんぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>州<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>冬期<rp>(</rp><rt>とうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すると、<ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するよりも<ruby>料金<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">冬季前往南部省份的旅游费用比现在的费用要高。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/13693215\" title=\"Tatoeba · ytmssroutlookcom\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · ytmssroutlookcom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">週</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">周；星期</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148148\"><ruby>週<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>一度<rp>(</rp><rt>いちど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でいいから<ruby>運動<rp>(</rp><rt>うんどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">每周至少锻炼一次</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">周囲</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">周围；周边；周遭；周长；周围长度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219442\">この<ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>周囲<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>３メートルある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这棵树有三米宽</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">収穫</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうかく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">收获；庄稼；收成；劳动成果；收益；结果；回报；捕获量；猎获量；渔获物</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166186\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちはみな<ruby>収穫<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>手伝<rp>(</rp><rt>てつだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いをした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们都帮助收割。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">週間</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうかん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">周；一周</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"194529\">もう２<ruby>週間<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たったら<ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我两周后回来</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">宗教</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうきょう</span></div><di